    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "e5gmu",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1160,
      "name": "Note layout",
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "content": "Calls grouped by day, newest first; no sorting and no column header. Row about 28 pt: start time (HH:mm), title, duration, status cell. Every column shows at every width: the window's minimum width is 560 pt, where the title still has about 330 pt. The title is one line and truncates with an ellipsis; nothing in a row wraps.\n\nDay header: Сегодня, Вчера; then weekday and date inside the last 7 days (Пятница, 7 ноября); older days the date (3 сентября), with the year only when it is not the current one (12 декабря 2025). The header counts the day's calls."
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "zk1Tu",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 1160,
      "name": "Note actions",
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "content": "Status cell, 64 pt, right-aligned: summary being prepared (spinner), summary failed (red alert), notes (eye; accent on the selected row, click shows notes). On hover the row tints and a ⋯ button appears at the cell's end, in no extra space; it opens the same menu as a right-click, below the button, right edges aligned. Повторить итоги appears only for a failed summary.\n\nKeys: ↑↓ select, Return opens, Space shows notes, ⌘R renames, ⇧⌘R shows in Finder, ⌘⌫ asks to delete. Double-click opens."
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "RTBJM",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 1160,
      "name": "Note states",
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "content": "Renaming: the title cell becomes a field; the folder prefix (yyyy.MM.dd-HHmm) stays fixed. Return saves, Esc cancels.\nConfirm delete: a sheet over the list with Удалить and Отмена.\nError: a banner pinned to the window's bottom, the list above it.\nWindow inactive: the selected row turns grey.\nEmpty and loading: one centred message.\n\nThe eye is accent only on the selected row of the active window."
    }
  ],
